@startuml
title Young-Onset T2D Biomarker Pipeline - Class Diagram
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

class NotebookOrchestrator {
  +run_project_setup()
  +load_dataset()
  +preprocess_expression()
  +run_differential_expression()
  +run_pathway_enrichment()
  +train_biomarker_model()
  +export_results()
}

class GEODataLoader {
  +download_raw_data()
  +parse_metadata()
  +load_expression_matrix()
}

class QCPreprocessor {
  +log_transform()
  +normalize()
  +filter_low_expression()
  +detect_outliers()
}

class DifferentialExpressionAnalyzer {
  +fit_model()
  +compute_log2fc()
  +adjust_pvalues()
  +rank_genes()
}

class PathwayEnrichmentAnalyzer {
  +map_genes()
  +run_go_enrichment()
  +run_kegg_enrichment()
  +run_reactome_enrichment()
}

class BiomarkerModeler {
  +select_features()
  +train_classifier()
  +validate_model()
  +evaluate_auc()
}

class ArtifactStore {
  +save_processed_data()
  +save_figures()
  +save_tables()
}

class Dataset {
  +accession
  +platform
  +tissue
  +phenotype
}

class ExpressionMatrix {
  +genes
  +samples
  +normalized
}

class GeneSignature {
  +selected_genes
  +selection_frequency
  +model_metrics
}

NotebookOrchestrator --> GEODataLoader : coordinates
NotebookOrchestrator --> QCPreprocessor : invokes
NotebookOrchestrator --> DifferentialExpressionAnalyzer : invokes
NotebookOrchestrator --> PathwayEnrichmentAnalyzer : invokes
NotebookOrchestrator --> BiomarkerModeler : invokes
NotebookOrchestrator --> ArtifactStore : exports outputs

GEODataLoader --> Dataset : creates
GEODataLoader --> ExpressionMatrix : loads
QCPreprocessor --> ExpressionMatrix : transforms
DifferentialExpressionAnalyzer --> ExpressionMatrix : analyzes
DifferentialExpressionAnalyzer --> GeneSignature : identifies
PathwayEnrichmentAnalyzer --> GeneSignature : interprets
BiomarkerModeler --> GeneSignature : selects
BiomarkerModeler --> ExpressionMatrix : trains on
ArtifactStore --> Dataset : stores metadata
ArtifactStore --> ExpressionMatrix : stores processed matrices
ArtifactStore --> GeneSignature : stores biomarker panel

@enduml
